    ["\"宠物\""] = "\"Pet\"",
    ["52 霍纳奇斯花海"] = "52 Hornacis Sea of Flowers",
    ["<Highlight>非凡物质</>：带有非凡力量的物质，可以填充入封印物来稳定历史投影，并解锁更多额外的非凡效果（非凡共鸣）。\n<Highlight>随机词条</>：非凡特性的力量量化为词条，不同非凡物质由于构成的非凡特性序列与数量不同，词条数量、类型与强度会有不同。最少有1条词条，最多可以达到6条词条，超过6条词条的非凡物质暂时未被发现。\n<Highlight>异变词条</>：非凡物质的随机词条受高位格力量影响或污染，可能会出现异变，异变词条相对于普通词条，会带来更为强大的效果。"] = "<Highlight> Beyonder Material </>: A substance containing Beyonder power that can be filled into a Sealed Artifact to stabilize the historical projection and unlock more additional Beyonder effects (Beyonder Resonance). \n <Highlight> Random Affixes </>: The power of Beyonder characteristics is quantified into affixes. Due to the different Beyonder characteristic sequences and quantities that make up different Beyonder materials, the number, type, and strength of affixes will vary. There is at least 1 affix, and up to 6 affixes can be reached; Beyonder materials with more than 6 affixes have not yet been discovered. \n <Highlight> Mutated Affixes </>: The random affixes of a Beyonder material may undergo mutation due to the influence or corruption of high-level powers. Compared to ordinary affixes, mutated affixes bring more powerful effects.",
    ["<P_Heart>（今早邻居的狗也一直对我叫，肯定是想跟我走吧，连狗都喜欢我。）</>"] = "<P_Heart> (The neighbor's dog has been barking at me all morning too, it must want to follow me, even dogs like me.) </>",
    ["<P_Heart>（清了清嗓子）</>咳咳！尊敬的，热心的，廷根杀鼠人……不，廷根卫生大使……请允许我代替卫生合作公司向您表达感谢。"] = "<P_Heart> (Clears throat) </> Ahem! Respected, enthusiastic, Tingen rat-killer... no, Tingen Hygiene Ambassador... please allow me to express my gratitude to you on behalf of the Hygiene Cooperation Company.",
