    ["为了获得胜利，各势力需要争夺战场中央平台上的<Highlight>死亡骑士</>。战斗结束时，会根据四皇势力积分排名获得不同档次的奖励，通过多次引领<Highlight>死亡骑士</>到达本阵营<Highlight>广场</>，获得大量势力积分，可提前结束战场，获得完胜奖励。\n以俱乐部为单位进行分配，将筛选非凡者人数、活跃度、非凡评分符合要求的俱乐部参与，获得资格的俱乐部非凡者可在以战养战-势力-高原战界面查看赛程安排。"] = "To achieve victory, each faction needs to compete for the <Highlight> Death Knight </> on the central platform of the battlefield. When the battle ends, different levels of rewards will be awarded based on the ranking of the Four Emperors faction points. By leading the <Highlight> Death Knight </> to your faction's <Highlight> plaza </> multiple times, you can obtain a large number of faction points, end the battlefield early, and obtain complete victory rewards. \n Allocation is done by club. Clubs that meet the requirements for the number of Beyonders, activity, and Beyonder score will be selected to participate. Qualified club Beyonders can view the schedule in the War-for-War - Faction - Plateau Battle interface.",
