    ["兜帽女人-笑：你不是一直都很奇怪，我们的高层为什么都是女性？\n兜帽女人：这就是答案。\n画面模糊，出现了特莉丝。\n她站在窗边，看着窗户里映照着的自己，用手轻轻摸着镜中自己的脸。\n特莉丝：不必再流浪、不必再挨饿、不必再被买卖……\n特莉丝：想要活下去，总要付出点代价，不是吗？"] = "Hooded Woman-laughs: Haven't you always wondered why our higher-ups are all women? \nHooded Woman: This is the answer. \nThe image blurs, and Trissy appears. \nShe stands by the window, looking at her reflection in the glass, gently touching her face in the mirror. \nTrissy: No more wandering, no more starving, no more being bought and sold... \nTrissy: To survive, one always has to pay a price, don't they?",
